# WS2-11. # Sources: spec/05-statements.md §16 and spec/11 (E10021: a read before assignment on every path) and spec/03 §3 (E10020: a read after a move).
An assignment only inside a loop body is not definite after the loop.
profiles: host
with: tok.clo
expect: reject E10021
contrast: let a: Tok;\n ==> let a: Tok = tok(5);\n
contrast-expect: accept
